[options="header",cols="10%,10%,10%,70%"]
|======

| Property
| Mandatory 
| Type
| Description


| currentPage
| yes
| integer
| Number of the current page.  Default: *0*.

| pageCount
| yes
| integer
| Number of the pages which can be found for the given per page count.  Default: *0*.

| perPage
| no
| integer
| Number of elements which can be included in a single page.

| totalCount
| yes
| integer
| Number of all elements which could be found.  Default: *0*.

|======
